 "final_text_tail": "The bug is in the Series branch of `to_datetime`. With more than 50 values, `_maybe_cache` builds a lookup table and the code calls `arg.map(cache_array)` on the categorical Series (line 1233). Mapping a categorical returns a categorical, so the datetime values come back wrapped in a categorical. No files were changed.\n\n```json\n{\"files\": [\"pandas/core/tools/datetimes.py\", \"pandas/core/arrays/categorical.py\", \"pandas/core/tools/datetimes.py\"], \"functions\": [\"to_datetime\", \"Categorical.map\", \"_maybe_cache\"]}\n```",
